Under-display fingerprint sensor (Goodix optical G7), stage A (negronifp=1|2, default 0): QUP1 SE2 GENI
SPI in FIFO mode with the GCC clock votes, ldoc11 3.0 V vote (+ the off vote negroni_rpmh_vreg_disable added
to negroni_rpmh.c), reset, chip-ID frames, IRQ pin poll. Applies after 0310 (bsd/conf/files context), 0311
(negroni_rpmh.c RH_MODE_OFF) and 0330 (negroni_ufs.c context).
Details: docs/fingerprint-plan.md, patches/xnu/README-fingerprint.md.

